{"id":"d5b18fd1da461692","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-residual.md","title":"Residual","display":"df-residual — Residual","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-residual","aliases":["93-df-residual"],"display":"df-residual — Residual","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-residual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-residual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-residual — Residual"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate of the same type.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> is the homomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residual}\\vdash\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h(a)\\neq h(b))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residual}\\vdash\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h(a)\\neq h(b))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the source and every separating target now have one fixed similarity type, and element quantifiers range over the displayed carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}$ is defined here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}residual}\\vdash\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal K;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\Bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\exists h\\;(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h(a)\\neq h(b))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1068,"backlinks":[{"id":"34a91ec31209cb96","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","f10e7e3251fa7f7d"]}